description:
Required experience and skills:
1 year of experience as a team leader;
3+ of experience with Python;
Experience with external APIs and systems;
Experience with testing frameworks;
Good knowledge of PostgreSQL or other databases;
Knowledge of Linux server environment;
English – Upper-Intermediate +.
Would be a plus:
Experience with Docker, Ansible, Terraform;
Certificate GCP Cloud Architect or Cloud Practitioner.
Working conditions:
5-day working week, 8-hour working day, flexible schedule;
Vacation and sick leave are covered by the company;
Remote work;
Healthcare (medical) program;
Maintaining health in the gym;
Corporate events (team buildings, holidays, etc.)
О компании A-listware
A-Listware is a tech company offering challenging and rewarding programming job opportunities for Ukrainian engineers. We work with international customers from product development to outsourcing and outstaffing.
We are located in the center of Kharkiv, yet in a quiet street with lovely cafes. Have cosy office, friendly family atmosphere and lots of fun! Come and join us!
